  "Act three. Grumble is still grumpy. Give him the flower.": "8a2ccd65b80c.mp3",
  "Across the sea, the road climbed to an old stone bridge, silver in the moonlight.": "2d0ef57c0a2f.mp3",
  "Under it lived Grumble, the grumpiest troll in all the land.": "e6d9d5115065.mp3",
  "And nobody, nobody at all, crosses Grumble's bridge without answering his riddle.": "e722ded3dff2.mp3",
  "Chapter five: The Clockwork Tower.": "13c11192ac54.mp3",
  "Act one. Sneak to the key. Move only when the searchlight looks away.": "8a6086a2edd5.mp3",
  "Act two. Take the key, and unlock the princess's cage.": "9cb9a3e5a5cd.mp3",
  "Act three. Clank attacks! Jump over his zaps until he overheats.": "955a8809e34a.mp3",
  "At last, the Clockwork Tower, ticking and whirring in the storm.": "6f1307052a16.mp3",
  "Inside, Princess Juniper waited in a cage, while Clank's searchlight swept the floor.": "834805646534.mp3",
  "Only a knight brave enough to sneak past it could set her free.": "acfb0a235746.mp3",
  "Chapter six: The Dragon's Cave.": "34f504bf304d.mp3",
  "Act one. It's dark in here. Give Sir Pip the lantern.": "59ca65b13bd1.mp3",
  "Act two. Find the music box's three jewels.": "ce54278dbc6d.mp3",
  "Act three. Take a final bow together.": "8678b7647789.mp3",
  "With the princess free, one thing was still missing: the music box's three jewels.": "4ea368ccdc43.mp3",
  "Clank had hidden them in the Dragon's Cave, among the glittering crystals. Luckily, it was Marlo's home.": "3a00f41b1844.mp3",
  "Find the jewels, and the music box will play again.": "193ac715177b.mp3",
  "Chapter seven: The Night Sky. The final adventure.": "cb30818eefab.mp3",
  "Act one. Climb aboard! Bring Sir Pip to Marlo.": "835f7c03aa5a.mp3",
  "Act two. Fly! Steer up and down through five glowing rings.": "456f5f344dfa.mp3",
  "Act three. Clank is throwing gears! Dodge four of them.": "2cca05d87f34.mp3",
  "Act four. Catch Clank! Fly right up to him.": "f9926cbd5a57.mp3",
  "Act five. Clank is lonely, not wicked. Show him kindness: bow to him.": "6fdab1ead2ee.mp3",
  "Act six. The King awaits. Kneel before him, and bow.": "d43725f19b71.mp3",
  "Back at the castle, the jewels were set into the music box, and the whole kingdom gathered to hear it play.": "b71b6ce8375b.mp3",
  "But Clank had one last trick. With a whir of clockwork wings, he snatched the music box and flew off into the night.": "cc679abd67b6.mp3",
  "There was only one way to catch him. Sir Pip climbed onto Marlo's back, and up, up, up they flew.": "105c82a04b2a.mp3",
  "Once upon a time, in a kingdom no bigger than a desk, every night ended with a song from a little golden music box.": "fefcb49ea263.mp3",
  "Each evening, Princess Juniper wound its tiny key, and the whole kingdom fell asleep smiling.": "19f440d8d448.mp3",
  "But one stormy night, Clank, a clockwork robot with a heart of rusty gears, crept into the castle.": "4f4ee1f6eba8.mp3",
  "He carried the princess away to his tower, and hid the music box's three jewels where no one would find them. The kingdom fell silent.": "138c27bb284c.mp3",
  "The king called for a hero. Nobody came. Nobody, that is, except one very small knight.": "177fc5d495e5.mp3",
  "His name was Sir Pip. He had shiny armour, a brave heart, and absolutely no idea what he was doing. And so, the quest began.": "564339a09993.mp3",
  "From that night on, the music box played every evening. And Clank, who had never had a friend, wound its tiny key himself.": "000442ff89ad.mp3",
  "Old Bramble remembered his birthday. Captain Pegg found a new crew. And Grumble let everyone cross his bridge, as long as they said hello.": "b39c4e5a2168.mp3",
  "And Sir Pip the Brave? He still had no idea what he was doing. But he had friends, and that was more than enough. The end.": "d0937cdcbc9b.mp3",
  "Caught! Back to the shadows.": "c93b871c0f18.mp3",
